### Frequently Asked Questions

**How does Inrank improve digital marketing ROAS?**  
Most agencies only focus on ad clicks. Inrank optimizes the full funnel: ad creatives, search intent matching, landing page speed (sub-1s load time), friction-free forms, and server-side conversion tracking (CAPI) to train ad algorithms faster.

**Do you charge a percentage of ad spend?**  
No. Inrank works on transparent, flat-fee monthly management sprints with zero percentage gouging. You pay Google and Meta directly from your credit card.

**How quickly can our campaigns go live?**  
Once creative assets, brand guidelines, and ad account access are finalized, our team stages and launches your campaigns within 48 to 72 hours.

